{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/TheGentlemen_ready.gif?t=1739197496\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Manners Be Damned!&quot;</strong> is a couch co-op party game in which you and up to 7 friends will compete in platforming challenges set in an ancient, deadly temple. The only tools you\u2019ll have are your fancy canes - great for pushing each other into trouble!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/Get_Sticked_Gif_v6.gif?t=1739197496\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But don\u2019t worry! Death is cheap - so play it fast and loose to try and get any advantage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/Get_Sticked_Gif_v5.gif?t=1739197496\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn points for your speed, agility and cane wielding mastery to prove you are the best gentleman!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/Get_Sticked_Gif_v3.gif?t=1739197496\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local co-op for up to 8 players (online play available with Steam Remote Play Together)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 distinct game modes (&quot;King of the Hat&quot; and &quot;Temple Dash&quot;)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hilarious player interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100% voice-recorded SFX </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accessible for all ages and skill levels </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GIVE US FEEDBACK!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Manners Be Damned!&quot;</strong> is still in active development, so we'd love to hear your first impressions and any feedback you might have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leave a review, or tell us directly in Discord!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/extras/JoinTheDiscord.gif?t=1739197496\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The link to join the Discord can be found on the right, amongst other info (or below, if you are on mobile).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3044620?t=1739197496","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3044620?t=1739197496","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/049cbf0884ffe8e680eacf4530e1de73a07932d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739197496","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3044620/049cbf0884ffe8e680eacf4530e1de73a07932d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739197496","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3258940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>How to play together</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>1. LOCALLY - the intended experience</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connect as many controllers as there are players and you're ready to go!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>2. ONLINE, using Steam Remote Play Together - results will depend on internet speed</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the game running, open the 